{"parse": {"title": "第二货币", "pageid": 127772, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"第二货币\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/27/CurrencyItem-3301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"第二货币\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>第二货币</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-3301 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-3301_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#3301</div></div><hr /><div>战时的“流通货币”，也许是你身上唯一靠得住的好伙计。可用于特别柜台兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">它们是行囊中最为贵重的物品，是饼干、起司和牛肉罐头。在野草丛、弹坑和泥泞地里，还有在与跟你一样倒霉的家伙打交道时，你会知晓它们的价值。记住，揣进兜里，捂紧一点。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "第二货币"}}